 A9lisateur%C2%B7rice%C2%B7s.%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3E%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20Alma%20MONSE
 RAND%2C%20%C3%A9conomiste%20%C3%A0%20l'ADEME%3Cbr%3E%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20Anto
 ine%20GODIN%2C%20%C3%A9conomiste%20%C3%A0%20l'AFD%20et%20chercheur%20assoc
 i%C3%A9%20au%20laboratoire%20ACT%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3ETable%20ronde%202.
 %20Models%2C%20indicators%20and%20scenarios%20in%20ecological%20macroecono
 mics%3A%20moving%20beyond%20existing%20frameworks.%3Cbr%3E%3Cbr%3E%C2%A0%2
 0%C2%A0%20Guilherme%20MORLIN%2C%20Associate%20professor%2C%20Universit%C3%
 A0%20di%20Pisa%3Cbr%3E%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20Fran%C3%A7ois%20BRIENS%2C%20Indepe
 ndent%20researcher%3Cbr%3E%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20Katie%20KEDWARD%2C%20Senior%20
